    "en": [
      "The postcard features a sepia-toned photograph of several men in historical attire standing atop a rocky outcrop, accessible by a stairway carved into the stone. The setting is natural, surrounded by trees, with a sign on the rock labeled 'Bülowshöhe.' The top left contains the printed text 'Bodetal i. Harz. Bülowsfelsen.' The bottom credits 'Brück & Sohn, Meissen.'"
